Third-party notice

This application is built on Remotion (https://remotion.dev), which is
distributed under its own licence, not the MIT licence above. Remotion is free
for individuals, for non-profit organisations and for companies with up to
three people. Larger companies need a Remotion company licence to use or
deploy this software. See https://www.remotion.dev/license for the terms.

Optional local text-to-speech on the desktop app downloads, at the user's
request, the sherpa-onnx engine (Apache License 2.0) and Piper voice models
(MIT, with per-voice dataset licences listed in each model card). Animated
emoji stickers are Noto Emoji by Google (Apache License 2.0 / OFL), fetched
from fonts.gstatic.com at display and render time.
